# A label names one element; a multi-element [...] group labels its elements.
# error: label_multi_group.grammar:13:11:
# error: label 'x' on a multi-element [...] group; label its elements
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
s = IDENT x:[IDENT IDENT]
